{
  "key": 19963,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_LectureAStudent",
      "en_US": [
        "Tailwind makes us faster, Trick\n",
        "Room makes us slower is faster…\r",
        "I’m so confused."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_TeacherMenu",
      "en_US": "What shall we do?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_OptDemo",
      "en_US": "Demo Battle"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_OptLecture",
      "en_US": "the Lecture"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_OptBye",
      "en_US": "That’s All"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_LarkspurLecture0",
      "en_US": [
        "Larkspur: Speed control.\n",
        "Welcome!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_LarkspurLecture1",
      "en_US": [
        "In a double battle, four Pokémon\n",
        "move every turn. Whoever\r",
        "controls the turn order controls\n",
        "the game.\r",
        "Tailwind doubles your side’s\n",
        "speed for four turns. Icy Wind\r",
        "and Electroweb hit both foes and\n",
        "slow them down."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_LarkspurLecture2",
      "en_US": [
        "Trick Room turns it all upside\n",
        "down: for five turns, the\r",
        "slowest move first. A slow,\n",
        "strong team loves it.\r",
        "And Fake out! It strikes first\n",
        "and makes the target flinch, but\r",
        "only on the turn it comes in."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_LarkspurLecture3",
      "en_US": [
        "Priority still matters: Extreme\n",
        "Speed, Bullet Punch and Sucker\r",
        "Punch. But beware Psychic\n",
        "Terrain and Quick Guard.\r",
        "Make the turn order yours.\n",
        "That’s my whole lesson!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_CamelliaLecture0",
      "en_US": [
        "Camellia: Setting up, with a\n",
        "partner. Shall we begin?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_CamelliaLecture1",
      "en_US": [
        "Setting up is harder with two\n",
        "attackers aimed at you. So bring\r",
        "a friend.\r",
        "Follow me and Rage Powder pull\n",
        "every single-target attack onto\r",
        "the partner. That’s a free turn\n",
        "for your sweeper."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_CamelliaLecture2",
      "en_US": [
        "Fake out stops one foe, Protect\n",
        "dodges the other, and your\r",
        "Dragon Dance goes off untouched.\r",
        "Intimidate on the partner\n",
        "softens physical attacks on both\r",
        "of you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_CamelliaLecture3",
      "en_US": [
        "Against setup? Hit the sweeper\n",
        "with both Pokémon at once, or\r",
        "strike past the redirection with\n",
        "a spread move.\r",
        "Haze and Clear Smog wipe the\n",
        "boosts away. A setup turn is\r",
        "only free if you make it free!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_DemoIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: A demonstration! A\n",
        "double battle, and we both use\r",
        "rentals, three each.\r",
        "My team shows off the lesson.\n",
        "Choose yours wisely!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_gGymChallengeIntroText",
      "en_US": "(missing text)"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_DemoWon",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Wonderful! Here,\n",
        "you’ve earned it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_RentalReturn",
      "en_US": [
        "Your own Pokémon are back with\n",
        "you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_DemoLost",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Ha! Think about the\n",
        "lesson and try again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0976_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_A_Academy_Text_EarnedBP",
